{"id":47319,"ord":31,"n_segments":152,"prev":47318,"next":47320,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Spirits of Rhythm and the road in the 1930s","title":"Philadelphia blues guitarists: Bobby Leecan and Lonnie Johnson","category":"person_portrait","summary":"Rosenberg names early Philly blues guitarists; Bunn knew Bobby Leecan and says they had playing contests which he always won.","period":"1930s","year_from":1930,"year_to":1939,"words":364,"start":[50,2],"end":[53,4],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125#s47319","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Philadelphia","focus":1,"type":"city"},{"name":"South Philadelphia","focus":1,"type":"neighborhood","in":"Philadelphia"},{"name":"South Street","focus":1,"type":"street","in":"Philadelphia"},{"name":"Greenwich Village","focus":0,"type":"neighborhood","in":"New York"}],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[{"name":"Bobby Leecan","qid":null,"n":8},{"name":"Eddie Lang","qid":"Q338957","n":2},{"name":"Lonnie Johnson","qid":"Q1351751","n":2}],"story":{"theme":12,"theme_name":"Banjo, guitar and the rhythm section: instruments and players","community":21,"community_name":"Banjo, guitar and the rhythm section's changing role","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":50,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Oh, yeah. Because there was a lot of blues players back in South Philly."},{"p":50,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":50,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"In the early '30s, right?"},{"p":50,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah, South Philly."},{"p":50,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Bobby Leecan."},{"p":50,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Bobby Leecan? I know him."},{"p":50,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Did you know him?"},{"p":50,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":50,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"You know, he was one of the originals, that guy."},{"p":50,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Original what?"},{"p":50,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I mean one of the early, really good blues players, like city blues players, from way back."},{"p":50,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Bobby Leecan?"},{"p":50,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah."},{"p":50,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. He played guitar."},{"p":50,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Right. Right. Him and who else was from Philly? Lonny Le Johnson --"},{"p":50,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Lonny Le Johnson."},{"p":50,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"-- played from Philly, right?"},{"p":50,"b":19,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":51,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Those were the big Philadelphia blues players."},{"p":51,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":51,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And then people like Eddy Lang would learn from them."},{"p":51,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":51,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"As far as the blues style, you know."},{"p":51,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":51,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Of course, Eddy Lang had his legitimate stuff together, too."},{"p":51,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":51,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"But the blues stuff, he used to work with those guys. South Street."},{"p":51,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"South Street."},{"p":51,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"All right. Yeah, right."},{"p":51,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"South Street."},{"p":51,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"South Street is -- that's a funky place, man South Street is forever. South Street is forever."},{"p":51,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"South Street. That's it."},{"p":51,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"But I don't know what exactly -- South Street. How about that."},{"p":51,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah, that's where it is."},{"p":51,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"South Street is all -- now is -- you've got the -- it's like a black neighborhood. And it's also like an area that's sort of like Greenwich Village."},{"p":51,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":52,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Down near the river."},{"p":52,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":52,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Down around 4th and 5th Streets, near the river. That's right. There was a lot of those cats used to -- I think Bobby Leecan was from that area, himself."},{"p":52,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Do you know him?"},{"p":52,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I heard a recording of his recently."},{"p":52,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He played guitar."},{"p":52,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah."},{"p":52,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Bobby Leecan."},{"p":52,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah."},{"p":52,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Bobby Leecan?"},{"p":52,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"But I heard an old recording of his,"},{"p":52,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"1923."},{"p":52,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":52,"b":13,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And it's real good."},{"p":52,"b":14,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Bobby Leecan."},{"p":52,"b":15,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Very advanced for that time, you know."},{"p":52,"b":16,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He's a light brown skinned boy."},{"p":52,"b":17,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah, well, of course, I guess he's --"},{"p":52,"b":18,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"You didn't know him, did you?"},{"p":52,"b":19,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"-- he's long gone."},{"p":52,"b":20,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Is he?"},{"p":52,"b":21,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I think so."},{"p":52,"b":22,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He's passed?"},{"p":52,"b":23,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah. Yeah."},{"p":53,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Bobby Lee Lee. Wow."},{"p":53,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"You knew him, though, huh?"},{"p":53,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Oh, yeah. Him and I had tests together about playing."},{"p":53,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"That's way back."},{"p":53,"b":4,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Not saying it because it's me, but I always won."}]}